  "description": "WP-C7 Codex: Adeptus Custodes (11e) ARCHEOTECH TELEPORT-SHUNTER (Shield-Captain in Allarus Terminator Armour, once per battle) through the real movement_phase_start window. Fixture cus11e_c7_move (P1 Custodes' Movement phase, battle round 2; the Shield-Captain leads the Allarus Custodians). The window offers the card (cost 'Ability') on the Attached unit; a real click places both units into strategic reserves (once-per-battle ledger marked) and they MUST make an ingress move this phase: END_MOVEMENT is refused until they are set up again (the reserves placement action at a battlefield edge); afterwards both are on the battlefield with the ingress arrival flags and the phase can end. Setup privileges: auto wound allocation; the Orks (P2) have 0 CP.",
  "fixture": "cus11e_c7_move",
  "edition": 11,
  "rng_seed": 7,
  "transition_to_phase": 7,
  "disable_ai": true,
